## What ships

`/llms.txt` is a compact map of the public product documentation. Every documentation page is also available as raw Markdown by appending `.md` to its URL.

```text
/docs
/docs.md
/docs/guides/workflow
/docs/guides/workflow.md
```

This gives people, coding tools, and documentation crawlers the same public source material without duplicating the content.

## Keep private context private

Only publish information that already belongs in public documentation. Repository-specific instructions stay in `AGENTS.md` and are not linked from `/llms.txt`.
